<title>POLAND: ELPO FEB NET RISES TO PLN 0.2 MLN.</title>
<headline>ELPO FEB NET RISES TO PLN 0.2 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results February</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.17 vs   0.07</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.23 vs   0.11</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.06 vs   0.14</p>
<p> Sales		    1.22 vs   1.25</p>
<p>JANUARY-FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.37 vs   0.13</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.52 vs   0.19</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.15 vs   0.22</p>
<p> Sales		    2.61 vs   2.32</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish garment maker is Zaklady</p>
<p>Odziezowe Elpo SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
